Core/Jessie: You really still wear that lab coat?
Core/Rose: Every day.
Core/Jessie: Even to bed?
Core/Rose: It’s comfortable.
Core/Jessie: You’re such a nerd.
Core/Rose: Says the woman who literally ran into fires for a living.
Core/Jessie: That’s different. That’s cool.
Core/Rose: Science is cool.
Core/Jessie: Whatever helps you sleep at night, Dr. Rose.
Core/Rose: I don’t have a doctorate yet—
Core/Rose: …I guess I never will now.
Core/Jessie: Hey. You fixed a radio tower by yourself. That counts for something.